  "content": "\n\n<h1>Unique Dark</h1>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252funique-dark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/modrinth@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Modrinth 上的 Unique Dark\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unique-dark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/curseforge@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"CurseForge 上的 Unique Dark\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/patreon@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Patreon 上的 amongstreality\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/bmc@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Buy Me a Coffee 上的 amongstreality\"></a></p>\n<p>此資源包為遊戲中每個功能性方塊提供了獨特的紋理。部分紋理需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252foptigui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiGUI</a>。</p>\n<p>Unique Dark 支援眾多不同的模組，且隨著幾乎每次更新都會持續擴充。</p>\n<h2>Unique Dark - 精簡版與完整版</h2>\n<p><strong>Unique Dark - 精簡版</strong> 可在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252funique-dark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unique-dark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> 上下載的版本。</p>\n<p><strong>Unique Dark - 完整版</strong> 可在我的 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> 與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Buy Me a Coffee</a> 上下載的版本。</p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>⚠️ <strong>警告：</strong>此資源包僅提供於上述平台下載，並在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252funique-dark%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Planet Minecraft</a> 擁有專屬頁面。若您於其他平台發現此資源包，<strong>請勿下載</strong>，因為它們屬於未經授權的非法轉發。下載連結可能導向惡意網站，且下載的內容可能含有病毒。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>以下列表列出精簡版與完整版分別包含哪些紋理，以及哪些需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252foptigui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiGUI</a> 才能正常運作。未收錄於精簡版的紋理也經過重新繪製，以符合本資源包的美術風格。</p>\n<h3>✅ 精簡版內含：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>工作台</li>\n<li>熔爐</li>\n<li>箱子</li>\n<li>銅箱子</li>\n<li>預設潛影貝箱</li>\n<li>鐵砧</li>\n<li>鐵砧變體</li>\n<li>附魔台</li>\n<li>村民</li>\n<li>村民職業變體</li>\n<li>可騎乘生物變體</li>\n<li>羊駝變體</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>✅ 完整版內含（除精簡版內容外）：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>高爐</li>\n<li>煙燻爐</li>\n<li>陷阱箱</li>\n<li>終界箱</li>\n<li>木桶</li>\n<li>銅箱子變體</li>\n<li>彩色潛影貝箱</li>\n<li>釀造台</li>\n<li>切石機</li>\n<li>磨石</li>\n<li>製圖台</li>\n<li>鍛造台</li>\n<li>織布機</li>\n<li>發射器</li>\n<li>投擲器</li>\n<li>自動組裝機</li>\n<li>漏斗</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>⚠️ 需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252foptigui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiGUI</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>陷阱箱</li>\n<li>終界箱</li>\n<li>木桶</li>\n<li>銅箱子</li>\n<li>銅箱子變體</li>\n<li>彩色潛影貝箱</li>\n<li>鐵砧變體</li>\n<li>發射器</li>\n<li>投擲器</li>\n<li>村民職業變體</li>\n<li>可騎乘生物變體</li>\n<li>羊駝變體</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>在此支援我與我的專案：</h2>\n<p>加入 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> 與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Buy Me a Coffee</a> 的「紫晶級」會員資格，即可取得 Unique Dark 的完整版。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/labeled/patreon@3x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/labeled/bmc@3x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Buy Me a Coffee\"></a></p>\n<h2>模組支援（目前涵蓋 79 個模組）</h2>\n<p>您可以<a href=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/Unique-Dark-Issues/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在此處</a>提出模組支援請求，我可能會在未來將其納入。目前已支援的模組如下：</p>\n\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faccessories\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Accessories</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancedae\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AdvancedAE</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ae2-import-export-card\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AE2 Import Export Card</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Caves</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apotheosis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apotheosis</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apothic-attributes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apothic Attributes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apothic-enchanting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apothic Enchanting</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apothic-spawners\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apothic Spawners</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AppleSkin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2-wireless-terminals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Applied Energistics 2 Wireless Terminals</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Applied Energistics 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-flu